{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"notes.psychology.vulnerable-narcissism-vs-growth","title":"Vulnerable Narcissism vs Growth Patterns","description":"Membedakan antara pola narsistik rapuh (neurotik) dengan proses pertumbuhan personal.","tags":["psychology","growth-mindset","npd","shame"],"custom":{"description":"Membedakan antara pola narsistik rapuh (neurotik) dengan proses pertumbuhan personal."},"fname":"notes.psychology.vulnerable-narcissism-vs-growth","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"946bef237f1e758a7ffb9c570547391c","updated":1782198659131,"created":1782198659131,"desc":"","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.vulnerable-narcissism-vs-growth","id":"notes.psychology.vulnerable-narcissism-vs-growth","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.psychology","alias":"psychology","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.psychology"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.vulnerable-narcissism-vs-growth","id":"notes.psychology.vulnerable-narcissism-vs-growth","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.growth-mindset","alias":"growth-mindset","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.growth-mindset"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.vulnerable-narcissism-vs-growth","id":"notes.psychology.vulnerable-narcissism-vs-growth","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.npd","alias":"npd","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.npd"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.vulnerable-narcissism-vs-growth","id":"notes.psychology.vulnerable-narcissism-vs-growth","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.shame","alias":"shame","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.shame"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.vulnerable-narcissism-vs-growth","id":"notes.psychology.vulnerable-narcissism-vs-growth","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.psychology.neurotic-narcissism","position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":11,"offset":1717},"end":{"line":26,"column":51,"offset":1757},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.psychology.neurotic-narcissism"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.vulnerable-narcissism-vs-growth","id":"notes.psychology.vulnerable-narcissism-vs-growth","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.psychology.boundary-vs-reality-check","position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":53,"offset":1759},"end":{"line":26,"column":99,"offset":1805},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.psychology.boundary-vs-reality-check"}},{"from":{"fname":"handbook.growth.exposure-ladder","id":"handbook.growth.exposure-ladder","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":47,"column":11,"offset":2920},"end":{"line":47,"column":63,"offset":2972},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.psychology.vulnerable-narcissism-vs-growth"}],"anchors":{"vulnerable-narcissism-vs-growth-patterns":{"type":"header","text":"Vulnerable Narcissism vs Growth Patterns","value":"vulnerable-narcissism-vs-growth-patterns","line":16,"column":0,"depth":1},"the-label-trap":{"type":"header","text":"The Label Trap","value":"the-label-trap","line":18,"column":0,"depth":2},"the-core-conflict-recognition-vs-risk":{"type":"header","text":"The Core Conflict: Recognition vs Risk","value":"the-core-conflict-recognition-vs-risk","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2},"growth-vs-stagnation-the-direction-of-energy":{"type":"header","text":"Growth vs Stagnation (The Direction of Energy)","value":"growth-vs-stagnation-the-direction-of-energy","line":29,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"k7whujrtxo2tvftwjvbq1jh","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"vulnerable-narcissism-vs-growth-patterns\">Vulnerable Narcissism vs Growth Patterns<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#vulnerable-narcissism-vs-growth-patterns\"></a></h1>\n<h1 id=\"vulnerable-narcissism-vs-growth-patterns-1\">Vulnerable Narcissism vs Growth Patterns<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#vulnerable-narcissism-vs-growth-patterns-1\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"the-label-trap\">The Label Trap<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#the-label-trap\"></a></h2>\n<p>Sangat mudah untuk melakukan <em>overcorrection</em> setelah mengetahui tentang <em>vulnerable narcissism</em>: \"Saya merasa insecure, berarti saya narsistik.\" Ini adalah jebakan label. Insecure bisa berasal dari banyak sumber: trauma, social anxiety, perfeksionisme, atau kurangnya validasi.</p>\n<p><strong>Framing yang Sehat</strong>: Alih-alih melabel diri sebagai \"NPD Neurotik\", gunakan deskripsi perilaku yang <em>actionable</em>: \"Saya memiliki pola malu, takut tampil, sensitif terhadap kredit, dan belum konsisten bergerak memperbaiki diri.\"</p>\n<h2 id=\"the-core-conflict-recognition-vs-risk\">The Core Conflict: Recognition vs Risk<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#the-core-conflict-recognition-vs-risk\"></a></h2>\n<p>Masalah utamanya seringkali bukan keinginan untuk tampil, melainkan keinginan untuk <strong>diakui tanpa harus mengambil risiko terlihat gagal</strong>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Mode Aman (Tongkrongan Kecil)</strong>: Risiko rendah <span class=\"math math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>→</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span></span></span></span></span> Ide mengalir, percaya diri muncul.</li>\n<li><strong>Mode Terancam (Forum Besar)</strong>: Risiko tinggi (dinilai, dipatahkan) <span class=\"math math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>→</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span></span></span></span></span> Diri menghilang/menarik diri.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"growth-vs-stagnation-the-direction-of-energy\">Growth vs Stagnation (The Direction of Energy)<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#growth-vs-stagnation-the-direction-of-energy\"></a></h2>\n<p>Perbedaan antara pola narsistik neurotik dan orang yang sedang tumbuh bukan terletak pada rasa sakitnya, melainkan pada <strong>arah energi setelah rasa sakit itu muncul</strong>.</p>\n<div class=\"table-responsive\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th align=\"left\">Pola Narsistik Neurotik (Stagnan)</th><th align=\"left\">Pola Pertumbuhan (Growth)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\">Berhenti pada narasi korban (\"Dunia tidak adil\", \"Ide saya dicuri\").</td><td align=\"left\">Mengakui rasa sakit, tapi mencari bagian yang bisa dilatih.</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\">Menggunakan luka sebagai alasan untuk tidak bergerak.</td><td align=\"left\">Mengubah luka menjadi sistem (dokumentasi, latihan bicara).</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\">Identitas dibangun di atas \"ketidakberdayaan\".</td><td align=\"left\">Identitas dibangun di atas \"proses perbaikan\".</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Atomic Idea</strong>: Pertumbuhan dimulai ketika luka diubah menjadi struktur.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>See also: <a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.neurotic-narcissism\">Neurotic Narcissism (Narcissistic Neuroticism)</a>, <a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.boundary-vs-reality-check\">Boundary vs Reality Check</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">psychology (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">growth-mindset (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">npd (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">shame (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/handbook.growth.exposure-ladder\">Exposure Ladder for Shame Regulation</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"dendronVersion":"0.83.0","vaults":[{"fsPath":"vault"}],"journal":{"dailyDomain":"daily","name":"journal","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd","addBehavior":"childOfDomain"},"scratch":{"name":"scratch","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd.HHmmss","addBehavior":"asOwnDomain"},"task":{"name":"","dateFormat":"","addBehavior":"childOfCurrent","statusSymbols":{"":" ","wip":"w","done":"x","assigned":"a","moved":"m","blocked":"b","delegated":"l","dropped":"d","pending":"y"},"prioritySymbols":{"H":"high","M":"medium","L":"low"},"todoIntegration":false,"createTaskSelectionType":"selection2link","taskCompleteStatus":["done","x"]},"graph":{"zoomSpeed":1,"createStub":false},"enableAutoCreateOnDefinition":false,"enableXVaultWikiLink":false,"enableRemoteVaultInit":true,"enableUserTags":true,"enableHashTags":true,"workspaceVaultSyncMode":"noCommit","enableAutoFoldFrontmatter":false,"enableEditorDecorations":true,"maxPreviewsCached":10,"maxNoteLength":20480